        1   using Progress.Lang.*.
        2   using Progress.Windows.Form.
        3   block-level on error undo, throw.
        4   class ibs.th.ref.marktype inherits Form:
        5     define public property vss-revision    as character no-undo init "$Revision:$":U get .
        6     define public property vss-author      as character no-undo init "$Author:$":U get.
        7     define public property vss-date        as character no-undo init "$Date:$":U get.
        8     define public property vss-workfile    as character no-undo init "$Workfile:$":U get.
